==Features and Overview==
==={{OoT|-}}===
{{Stub|OoT3D}}
The Stable is located in [[Lon Lon Ranch]]. It is where the Ranch keeps its [[Cow]]s, as well as its [[Horse]]s at night. [[Ingo]] can be found working in the Stable when [[Link]] is a child. When Link returns as an adult, [[Malon]] can be found in the Stable working during the day. After ending Ingo's takeover of the Ranch, [[Talon]] will be found in the Stable during the day instead.

