==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Stub|TotK}}
Although most of the Stables present in {{BotW}} still remain, there have been some changes, including the addition of two [[Mini Stable]]s.<ref name="TotK Map"/>

[[New Serenne Stable|Serenne Stable]] relocated south to [[North Hyrule Plain]] after the road west of [[Carok Bridge]] was constructed.<ref name="TotK Traysi"/> Due to a lack of customers caused by the [[Extreme Cold Snap]] in [[Hebra]], [[Rito Stable]] was shut down and most of the residents had to leave.<ref name="TotK Ariane"/><ref name="TotK Lester 2"/> [[Traysi]] opportunistically purchased the Stable from [[Galli]] and converted it into the [[Lucky Clover Gazette]].<ref name="TotK Penn"/><ref name="TotK Galli"/>

In addition, all Stables now give off a horseshoe-shaped [[Smoke Signal]].

