<ref name="TotK Traysi">{{Cite|Let's see... Right around now, he should be canvassing {{Color TotK|Red|New Serenne Stable}}. It's a place out to the east, past the {{Color TotK|Red|Skyview Tower}}. It used to be somewhere else, but after the new road was built, the place moved to the new location. Seems like it was the right move—business is booming there! I'm not sure if that's why he headed out there though. All he said was "The little birds are calling!" Then he took off with a big grin on his face.|Traysi|TotK}}</ref>
<ref name="TotK Ariane">{{Cite|It was a stable much like this one, but in front of {{Color TotK|Red|Rito Village}} to the {{Color TotK|Red|west}} of here. The {{Color TotK|Red|big cold snap}} shut it down though. I think it was replaced by a newspaper company or something. {{Color TotK|Red|Hebra}} was always cold, but it's gotten really bad. If you go to {{Color TotK|Red|Rito Village}}, you need to {{Color TotK|Red|prepare for extreme weather}}.|Ariane|TotK}}</ref>
<ref name="TotK Lester 2">{{Cite|[Who are you?] I used to work at Rito Stable in {{Color TotK|Red|Hebra}}. Had a good job taking care of horses. But the cold there kept getting colder, and business got slower. In time, we had to close. Last I heard, the place had been bought out by the {{Color TotK|Red|Lucky Clover Gazette}}. Just when I was feeling adrift, Purah reached out to me about managing the horses here at Lookout Landing... And before I knew it, here I was.|Lester|TotK}}</ref>
<ref name="TotK Penn">{{Cite|Oh, wait a minute... It's you! I gotta say, you did a good job getting out here to find us. It's quite a hike from Lookout Landing when you haven't got wings, but here you are! Was it easy to find the place? Some folks pass by without a second look. After all, it was a stable, until Traysi cheated the previous owner out of it. But you don't miss a thing, do you? Not bad, not bad at all... I assume you came for the job. You want to work for the newspaper, right? I'll vouch for you with Traysi. Just picture it! Traveling the world as a reporter, shining light on the truth! We'll be partners out there.|Penn|TotK}}</ref>
<ref name="TotK Galli">{{Cite|This place was once a stable. And I was once its owner. But when that terrible cold wave rolled in, it froze up our business along with the rest of Hebra. Which is why the stable is closed and the {{Color TotK|Red|Lucky Clover Gazette}} has bought out the old space. I don't have anywhere else to go, so I thought I'd try to help out around here. Not that I'm much good at it. I just learned the terrifying way what happens when you burn a {{Color TotK|Red|Hylian pine cone}}...|Galli|TotK}}</ref>
